---
import Diagram from './Diagram.astro';
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/hypothesis-funnel-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/hypothesis-funnel-dark.svg?raw';
---

<Diagram
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  maxWidth={680}
  caption="Cheap and asynchronous runs first; the onsite exists to kill hypotheses, not to collect more of them."
>
  Six automated system-scan passes and five survey instruments (57 people)
  feed nine named hypotheses, each written with confirming and killing
  evidence. Day one narrows the nine to the five with the strongest signal;
  the other four keep their pre-work evidence and lose their interview slots.
  Days two and three run targeted interviews against the five, producing
  scored evidence chains that become the friction register, the 30/60/90
  plan, and the leave-alone list.
</Diagram>
